{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_greyy_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_greyy_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"過濾星星","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_greyy_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"96ecd2cb65ce3f99fdf162326e2266e8849ccc8525f5233a2158acbd5a1bda47","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"橫遭突變的男孩，心中仍舊懷著父母的教誨。在被救起之後，他決定用自己的方式表達感謝。","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拿上東西，是貧民區那邊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"到晚上才拿到消息，我們已經遲了，看看還能不能做點什麼......把醫療設備都準備好，我們要在這裡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——不能在這裡，現在還不確定到底發生了什麼，穩妥起見我們不能太招搖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你說的對......把醫療帳篷拿出來吧，山後樹林從來都沒人去，在那裡搭。我們去貧民區一趟！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，孩子，醒醒？能聽見我們說話嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"身上沒有源石結晶，看不出來是不是感染者......他抱了個什麼，一根法杖嗎？這麼小的孩子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走，快回去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"帶回來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了，接下來交給我就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"不確定這個孩子是不是感染者，他一直抱著這根法杖，應該是會點法術——還要我們再做點什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"你們先休息一下吧，我去給他做個檢查。辦事處裡留了幾個人守著消息，你們只要保證這裡不會被人發現就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"好！我去弄點宵夜給你們墊墊肚子，這孩子看上去也沒怎麼吃飯，我準備點粥來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那我先進去了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"才十幾歲吧......這種年紀的孩子就受這種苦，唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"體表無明顯礦石病病灶，但......根據檢測結果，已經是感染者了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"傷口不算嚴重，但身體虛弱，用上源石技藝加速癒合......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"抑制劑還有儲備，鎮定劑已經注射。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（發電機好吵，檢查也做完了，接下來用不上這些設備了，燈開著也太亮，不容易安睡。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（把燈給他關上，我再去把發電機關了，讓這個孩子睡個好覺吧。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（定個時，過兩個小時再來看一下。)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑暗的帳篷裡，小小的身影蜷縮在床上。\n發燒和疲勞帶來的身體上的痛苦抵消了藥劑帶來的鎮靜作用，他在並不平和的夢中突然想去尋找些什麼。\n也許是父母的懷抱，也許是家的溫暖。\n這些讓人感到幸福的事物在一天前已經離開他遠去，即使沒有清晰地意識到，現在在夢裡他仍舊為失去這些而感到痛苦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......好黑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也沒有人......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......真的好黑，這裡也沒有電嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咿、旁邊有什麼東西......輸液瓶？媽媽送我出來後......我、我被救了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"周圍有什麼嗎......啊，我的法杖還在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，是兩個叔叔找到了我，是他們把我帶到這裡來了，我一定要謝謝他們......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下床看看，呼......啊......坐起來都好累......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......誰都不在，只有我一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，媽媽怎麼什麼都不給我說，只讓我往外跑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我和爸爸媽媽，還能再見嗎，嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼黑又一個人都沒有，他們是不是遇到什麼事了......我、我會法術的，媽媽教過我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"虛弱的男孩倚躺在病床上，伸手去勾放在床邊的法杖。\n法杖是他自己一點一點拼出來的，破損的零件，廢棄的礦石，終於在某一天於他手中發出了光芒。\n“光芒”，他想著這個詞。他想點起一團光，去幫助救了他的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個玻璃燈罩居然沒有破損，還有這些齒輪和螺釘，明明都還很好，只是因為機器不能用了就被扔了，真可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過零件已經收集齊了！把這個線接到面板上面，再連到這裡......用下法術試試看？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇，電到了！好痛......好難啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸媽媽還沒回家，一定要在他們回來前做好，他們一定會很高興的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等以後找到好工作，我要給媽媽買很多藥，把她的病治好，爸爸也不用在工廠打工......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿......擰螺絲好費勁，爸爸的力氣真的很大，每次做什麼都能很快做好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！一定要在他們回來前做好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽，你看！你教我的法術，我能用在這個法杖上了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿——看，亮起來了！這個法杖也是我自己拼的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽教我的法術我都記得，我都記在本子上了，增高電壓——嘿！快看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我學得很快吧，我要做這裡最厲害的法術師，我要讓我們家有用不完的電，白天也可以開燈！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽，等下，他們都說出去了就會得病，你不要——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是爸爸的工廠？爸爸還沒回來，爸爸在那裡？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我去，媽媽讓我也去，我也會法術，我也能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"在無數個夢裡，他勇猛地衝出被母親鎖上的家門，力大無窮地掀開工廠裡那些泛著光澤的廢渣，大人們嘴裡可怕的病對他沒有任何影響。\n他用母親教他的法術照亮了半片天空，人們在他的光下救治著一個又一個昏迷不醒的工人，他的爸爸只受了輕傷，也加入了救人的隊伍。\n回家後，他們搬離了這裡，到了一個空氣裡不再飛著粉塵的地方。\n他學會了更多的法術，和爸爸媽媽一起，一直幸福地生活著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咿——拿到了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......只有一點點，只能照亮一點點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是足夠了，能照亮腳下的路，就可以幫到別人了......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"冰冷的空氣湧入鼻腔，虛弱的佩洛男孩一直想做到像夢裡那樣的事。\n工廠的廢墟前，他第一次見到媽媽使用了這麼大規模的法術，光芒湧入黑夜，照亮著廢墟裡的每一個角落。\n他也想做出那種，能夠用自己的光幫助別人的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咿、好冷——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帳篷好大，這裡真的沒有人，他們、他們都去哪裡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸說過，能幫到別人的時候一定要去幫，這樣、這樣我們才能生活得更好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好黑，不會真的出事了吧......我、我要去——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚、渾身都好酸......外面是哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"樹林？是、是山後面那片嗎......好遠啊......這片樹林媽媽給我說過，這裡、這裡很少有人來，很危險......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼晚了，他們也沒有燈，肯定需要我幫忙，我、我要像媽媽那樣......幫到別人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要去外面找他們......！我、我一定要幫到他們！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳、我走了多久了......怎麼還是沒有人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚、頭好暈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，堅持住，我要說到做到，我要堅強，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩個小時後"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（三點五十，該去看看了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......！帳篷門怎麼是開的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"這孩子去哪了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"完了，都怪我，兩個小時果然還是太長了......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"快，救回來的那個小孩不見了，你們也在周圍找找——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡沒有——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"這片也沒有——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡、那裡怎麼有團光？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"——啊、找到了，在這裡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"第二天早晨"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔、天亮了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——你醒啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"來，喝點水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"我去給你熱一點粥。昨天晚上就煮上了，你現在都不用嚼，直接咽下去也不用擔心腸胃受不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊、您，謝、謝謝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我昨天不是——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......那個，很抱歉......沒能照顧好你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"並、並沒有！是我自己想跑出去，我覺得外面太黑了才——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"——粥來啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"說什麼呢？快別光顧著說話了，你一直都沒吃東西呢，先喝點墊墊肚子，莉塔說待會兒還要再做一次檢查呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我來了！這孩子醒了？來，我扶你坐起來，昨天大半夜的亂跑，現在肯定沒力氣了吧？莉塔先去忙你那邊的，這裡我倆先照顧著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"好，辛苦你們了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"檢查結束了，沒什麼問題，只是有些營養不良。礦石病目前也處於輕症狀態，具體的要去其他地方用更專業的設備再測一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，別擔心！叔叔和阿姨把你救了，就不會中途再把你扔出去，你一定要安心地在這裡把身體給養好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我們有些事情要給你說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"對，我們是一個叫羅德島的醫療公司的辦事處成員，現在這裡是一個臨時搭起來的醫療帳篷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天我們討論了下，我們現在的條件......有些抱歉，沒辦法長時間保證你的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你知道你住的地方發生了什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽把我送了出來，讓我一定往遠處跑，然後她、她就又回去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸前幾天說要去工廠找新的工作，然後，就沒回來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......剩下的，我就不太清楚了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"那，你知道自己生病的事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道的......他們都說這種病得了身上就會長石頭，我們那裡很多人都得了這個病......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"那......你的父母，都是感染者嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......工廠發生了事故......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"把人逼成感染者，再把感染者逼到絕路，這群*玻利瓦爾俚語*！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，小孩子面前！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......是我激動了，但這事也太......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你你你快和他說，再聽下去真的要氣死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"我們昨天討論的東西就是，想給你講一下我們公司，看看你喜不喜歡那裡，或者，願不願意去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這裡有器械，但羅德島的會比我們這裡的更好，而且，你不是會一些電能的法術嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡有很多很厲害的哥哥姐姐、叔叔阿姨，他們會很多很厲害的法術，你能在那裡學到更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"會更厲害的法術嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，對。你現在的法術是誰教你的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我的媽媽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，叔叔不是故意說髒話的，你、你父母的事情......我們很抱歉，但是我們會在這裡繼續幫你找他們的下落的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您、您不用和我道歉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們救了我，我很感謝......我也很想、很想在這裡做點什麼報答你們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我會一點電能法術的，昨天我半夜醒來過一次，這裡很黑，一個燈都沒有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這裡，也和我家那裡一樣，是沒有電的吧？我、我想給你們這裡發一些電......作為我現在、我的報答......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我昨天看到這裡這麼黑，你們是不是遇到事情了？可是，我、我走到一半就昏過去了，醒來又回到了床上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我的法杖，但是昨天我太累了，它沒有那麼亮......我平時能讓它照亮整個屋子的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"你昨天是為了讓這裡亮起來才......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯、嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用了媽媽教我的那些法術後，我的法杖能亮很久！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有幫到你們嗎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（他原來......是為了這個才......！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"對！你有幫到我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天這兩個叔叔晚上迷路了，外面那麼黑，他們就是看到了你的法杖發出的光，才找到了回這裡的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"他們一直想和你說謝謝來著，早上一忙就給忘了，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯！對！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都打算在外面過夜了，結果模模糊糊地看到一團光，一路走過來就看到你了。要是沒有你，我們都看不見路！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"（使眼色）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"（恍然大悟）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"對的！你的光在晚上真的很亮，真的很謝謝你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真、真的嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚！那我......那我願意去！我一定會好好養好身體，再學更多更好的法術，回來再幫你們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道我在這裡現在也幫不上你們的忙，我的爸爸媽媽......我也不知道他們在哪裡，還需要你們幫我找他們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我把病治好了！我一定會回來，回來讓這裡的晚上，亮起來......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"那，我們會在這裡好好地等你回來的，說好了哦？一定要學很多很多法術，我們這裡很需要你的幫助哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你叫什麼名字？我們到現在還不知道你叫什麼呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"對呀，我們這裡每個人都有代號，但是我們幾個認識得早，所以互相叫的是本名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫費托，他叫佩德羅，這個阿姨叫莉塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"辦事處幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在決定要去本艦了，給自己也取個代號吧，取個自己喜歡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虛弱的佩洛男孩","speakerId":"avg_253_greyy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我叫，格雷伊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["醫療幹員"]}]}
